{"id":"ae58bbf1212091b2","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule.md","title":"半等式条件规则","display":"df-conditional-rewrite-rule — 半等式条件规则","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-rule]]"],"label":"56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule","aliases":["56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule"],"display":"df-conditional-rewrite-rule — 半等式条件规则","type":"definition","source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definition 3.5.2, printed pp81–82","source_ocr_block":"102–103","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"98838138a402c043\" href=\"?note=98838138a402c043\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-rule\">56-df-rewrite-rule</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-conditional-rewrite-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conditional-rewrite-rule — 半等式条件规则"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definition 3.5.2, printed pp81–82"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"102–103"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 表示 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98838138a402c043\" href=\"?note=98838138a402c043\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-rule\">56-df-rewrite-rule</a> 中合法无条件规则的集合。条件列表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\times T\">\\(T\\times T\\)</span> 的有限序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(l,r,c)\">\\((l,r,c)\\)</span> 编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\\to r\\Leftarrow c_1\\approx d_1,\\ldots,c_k\\approx d_k\">\\(l\\to r\\Leftarrow c_1\\approx d_1,\\ldots,c_k\\approx d_k\\)</span>。条件中的变量可以不出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\">\\(l\\)</span> 中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\\{(l,r,c):(l,r)\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V),\\ c\\in(T\\times T)^{&lt;\\omega}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\\{(l,r,c):(l,r)\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V),\\ c\\in(T\\times T)^{&lt;\\omega}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C^{\\mathrm u}\\coloneqq\\{(l,r):\\exists c\\;((l,r,c)\\in C)\\}\\quad(C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C^{\\mathrm u}\\coloneqq\\{(l,r):\\exists c\\;((l,r,c)\\in C)\\}\\quad(C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 Definition 3.5.2（印刷 pp81–82，OCR 页块102–103）。本节点固定半等式格式，条件的转换语义由下一节点的最小分层关系确定；空条件列表涵盖普通规则。底层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(l,r)\">\\((l,r)\\)</span> 必须满足变量条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-rule","status":"re